NuttX-13.1.0
------------

What's New In This Release
Major Changes to Core OS
Sched
* [#19487](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19487) sched: avoid dumping raw memory at address 0 for tasks without kstack
* [#19884](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19884) sched: Fix stdio initialization of standard streams when buffering is disabled
* [#19767](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19767) sched: supplementary groups and setresuid/setresgid
* [#19852](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19852) sched,fs,docs: support setuid sudo helper
* [#19544](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19544) sched/addrenv: do not dereference a NULL address environment
* [#19479](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19479) sched/backtrace: fix cross-CPU buffer access under addrenv
* [#19905](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19905) sched/clock: fix stale CLOCK_MONOTONIC on SCHED_TICKLESS
* [#19578](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19578) sched/group: add POSIX saved UID/GID APIs and pseudo-fs ownership
* [#19118](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19118) sched/group: implement saved-set-UID/GID semantics
* [#19068](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19068) sched/Kconfig: Fix ETC_ROMFS dependency
* [#19380](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19380) sched/misc/coredump.c: guard tcb->name in coredump
* [#19587](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19587) sched/sched: Fix uninitialized sporadic params returned by nxsched_get_param()
* [#19563](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19563) sched/sched_critmonitor: remove duplicate preemption start block
* [#19678](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19678) sched/semaphore: Clear mutex blocking bit after timeout
* [#19733](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19733) sched/semaphore: Keep a negative task id out of the mutex holder.
* [#19687](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19687) sched/setpriority: handle CPU affinity change for running task
* [#19116](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19116) sched/signal: Fix compilation with ENABLE_PARTIAL_SIGNALS=y
* [#19734](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19734) sched/signal: Unblock sigtimedwait through kernel memory.
* [#19977](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19977) sched/sporadic: clear policy flag when stopping sporadic scheduling
* [#19972](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19972) sched/sporadic: fix policy switch and cross-task setparam
MM
* [#19146](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19146) mm gran reject oversized pools
* [#19198](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19198) mm,boards/arm/qemu: Fix KASAN user-space false positives, global region link error, and linker script section placement.
* [#19043](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19043) mm/kasan: Fix compile options applied to wrong target in SPLIT build
* [#19581](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19581) mm/ubsan: fix signed inline value decoding
libc
* [#19497](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19497) lib/math32: Avoid __uint128_t casts for LDC ImportC
* [#19330](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19330) libs: netdb: Advance stream buffers by transfer count
* [#19513](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19513) libs/libbuiltin/compiler-rt: skip unsupported Arm VFP builtins asm
* [#19444](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19444) libs/libc: Fix divide-by-zero in stat() with large filesystem block sizes
* [#19594](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19594) libs/libc: support explicit bases up to 36
* [#19016](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19016) libs/libc/dirent: preserve errno on readdir() end-of-directory
* [#19939](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19939) libs/libc/elf: Give a shared object a word alignment, not zero.
* [#19941](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19941) libs/libc/elf: Translate link-time addresses through one place.
* [#19856](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19856) libs/libc/machine/risc-v: Correct RISC-V optimized functions.
* [#19730](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19730) libs/libc/netdb: Size an answer header by its header, not by its union.
* [#19121](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19121) libs/libc/pthread/pthread_mutex: Fix robust mutex initialization
* [#19781](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19781) libs/libc/risc-v: Refresh memcpy and memset with XLEN-adaptive loops.
* [#19782](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19782) libs/libc/risc-v: Add optimized string and memory functions.
* [#19593](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19593) libs/libc/symtab: fix allsyms
* [#19857](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19857) libs/libc/string: Copy and compare by words when pointers agree on alignment.
* [#19870](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19870) libs/libc/string: Speed up the BSD string functions and fix memrchr/memset bugs
* [#19024](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19024) libs/libc/time: Add configuration options for the strftime
* [#19412](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19412) libc/builtin: support per-application priority/stacksize under KERNEL…
* [#19246](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19246) libc/crc32: add IEEE-compatible crc32_ieee for Linux/zlib interop
* [#19639](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19639) libc/dlfcn: Count opens so a library can be shared
* [#19183](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19183) libc/grp: add getgrouplist()
* [#19402](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19402) libs/libdsp: Add Matrix operations
* [#19329](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19329) libc/stream: Check lowout bounds before access
* [#19516](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19516) libc/time: Fix POSIX timezone string parsing
* [#19182](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19182) libc/unistd: add getgroups()
* [#19244](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19244) stdlib/rand: replace weak LCG with xorshift32 PRNG
tools
* [#19314](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19314) tools: avoid returning from finally blocks
* [#19058](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19058) tools: Enable Rust sim builds on Intel Macs
* [#19313](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19313) tools: escape Python string backslashes
* [#19569](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19569) tools: fix stale archive members surviving a Kconfig-driven CSRCS change
* [#19322](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19322) tools: kconfig2html: Handle blank input lines
* [#19320](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19320) tools: rp2040: Drop uninitialized name length check
* [#20022](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/20022) tools/export: prefix each linker script in toolchain.cmake
* [#19841](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19841) tools/cxd56/mkspk: proper resources free on error.
* [#19566](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19566) tools/mkallsyms.py: let the dependency error actually reach the user
* [#19839](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19839) tools/mkversion: Fix missing free in case of error.
* [#19556](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19556) tools/nxstyle: add a script to check a whole tree at once
* [#19375](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19375) tools/nxstyle: Add exclusion for MQTTErrors
* [#19237](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19237) tools/nxstyle: Add symbols for drivers/crypto/pnt/pnt_se05x_api.c
* [#19955](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19955) tools/nxstyle: allow a macro taking a block to span several lines
* [#19944](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19944) tools/nxstyle: allow CPython API identifiers
* [#19921](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19921) tools/nxstyle: align a right brace with the brace it closes
* [#19934](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19934) tools/nxstyle: check alignment of statements without a leading keyword
* [#19933](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19933) tools/nxstyle: indent code against its enclosing brace, not modulo 4
* [#19961](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19961) tools/nxstyle: let an alternative branch hold statements before its braces
* [#19962](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19962) tools/nxstyle: require a blank line after a function's declarations
* [#19956](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19956) tools/nxstyle: recognise typedef'd type names in declarations
* [#19920](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19920) tools/nxstyle: require braces around control statement bodies
* [#19006](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19006) tools/nxstyle: Whitelist Micro XRCE-DDS uxrCustomTransport prefix
* [#19779](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19779) tools/rust: Fix softfloat abi target spec name
* [#19465](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19465) tools/uncrustify: Update uncrustify for better support
* [#19477](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19477) tools/Zig.defs: Fix Zig builds on sim:x86_64
crypto
* [#19294](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19294) crypto: Support SHA2_224_HMAC
* [#19441](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19441) crypto: add CRYPTO_AES_CTR_SSH variant (128-bit big-endian counter)
* [#19403](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19403) crypto: add CRYPTO_CHACHA20_DJB variant (64-bit counter/nonce)
* [#19396](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19396) crypto: Add standalone CHACHA20 stream cipher on the unified enc path.
audio
* [#19686](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19686) audio: fix private buffer allocation and document the upper half
video
* [#19466](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19466) video: fix EDID standard timing decode
* [#19053](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19053) video/fb: Handle case of multiple displays where some do not require update
* [#19047](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19047) video/fb: Trigger updatearea() if CONFIG_FB_UPDATE is defined
* [#19685](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19685) video/rgbcolors: Fix RGBTO8 to use the high bits of each component.
* [#19986](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19986) video/videomode: Fix EDID parsing and formatting of video mode dumps
wireless
* [#20003](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/20003) wireless/bluetooth: fix inverted MTU cap in bt_conn_send()
* [#19840](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19840) wireless/bluetooth/bt_hcicore.c: Balance conn and buffer references in hci_acl().
* [#19675](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19675) wireless/lpwan: add SX1301 concentrator, board support and SX127X fixes
include
* [#19238](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19238) !include/fcntl.h: align open flags with Linux values
* [#19866](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19866) include/atomic.h: add __has_include fallback and adjust __ATOMIC_xxx logic
* [#19891](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19891) include/cxx/{cstdlib,cmath}: Provide std::abs(float) overloads
* [#19060](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19060) include/cxx/cmath: Define FLT_EVAL_METHOD from compiler builtin
* [#19064](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19064) include/cxx/ctime: Add localtime to std namespace.
* [#19231](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19231) include/fcntl.h: remove O_RDOK/O_WROK aliases
* [#20023](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/20023) include/macro.h: fix SE_ARG/FOREACH_ARG for empty args in C++
* [#19927](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19927) include/nuttx: Add link-time iterable sections infrastructure
* [#19044](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19044) include/nuttx/semaphore.h: parenthesize NXSEM helper args
* [#19109](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19109) include/pthread : initialize wait_count in PTHREAD_COND_INITIALIZER
* [#19008](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19008) include/unistd: add dpopen/dpclose declarations
Changes to the Build System
cmake
* [#19507](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19507) cmake: Do not link an executable to detect the compiler.
* [#19548](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19548) cmake: Omit default priority ELF symbol.
* [#20021](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/20021) cmake: parse EXTRAFLAGS with separate_arguments
* [#19464](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19464) cmake: Sanitize NAME for _main symbol generation
* [#19755](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19755) cmake: Use NUTTX(_DIR/_BIN_DIR) instead CMAKE(_SRC_DIR/_BIN_DIR)
* [#19029](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19029) cmake/nuttx_toolchain.cmake: track preprocessed include deps
Architectural Support
New Architecture Support
* [#19935](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19935) arch/arm: initial STM32U3 architecture support
* [#19967](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19967) arch/arm: Add initial support for STM32C5
* [#19236](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19236) arch/arm: add Realtek RTL8721Dx and RTL8720F (Ameba IOT) support
* [#19850](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19850) arch/arm: add stm32u0 support
* [#19931](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19931) arch/arm/stm32h7: add initial STM32H7R/S support
* [#19422](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19422) arch/mips: Add basic support for MIPS Creator CI20 board
Architectures Improvements
* [#19438](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19438) arch: fix host_flags_to_mode() O_RDONLY sentinel collision
ARM
* [#19565](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19565) arch/arm: carry CONTROL over to the fork child on Cortex-M
* [#19206](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19206) arch/arm: fix DMA transfers with sizes smaller than 4 bytes.
* [#19721](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19721) arch/arm: Fix FlexCAN config initializers clobbering rx_pin instead of enable_high
* [#19534](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19534) arch/arm: Fix Kconfig style
* [#19220](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19220) arch/arm: remove duplicate .globl for up_saveusercontext
* [#19510](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19510) arch/arm: Reserve r10 via ARCHCFLAGS, and hoist the duplicated PIC module flags.
* [#19486](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19486) arch/arm: set PSPLIM to top of TLS region to protect it from overflow
* [#19175](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19175) arch/arm/armv7-a: Fix L1 page table entry double-offset in addrenv create region
* [#19141](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19141) arch/arm/at32/at32_can: Division by Zero in CAN Bit Timing Commands
* [#19040](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19040) arch/arm/gd32f4: fix NULL pointer dereference in arm_earlyserialinit.
* [#19112](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19112) arch/arm/gd32f4: fix missing CTL selector bits in up_disableusartint.
* [#19957](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19957) arch/arm/imxrt: Keep FlexCAN TX mailbox allocation in order.
* [#19970](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19970) arch/arm/imxrt: Fix FlexCAN TX timeout aborting live mailboxes.
* [#20008](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/20008) arch/arm/imxrt: Unify FlexCAN TX work and add SIOCGCANERRORS.
* [#19691](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19691) arch/arm/kinetis/rtc: Enable global lock for all
* [#19233](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19233) arch/arm/lpc2378: Fix LPC2378 to work again
* [#19234](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19234) arch/arm/lpc214x: Fix LPC214x to work again
* [#19738](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19738) arch/arm/nrf52: add SAADC continuous sampling mode
* [#19542](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19542) arch/arm/nrf52,nrf53: don't pass HCI messages under the lock
* [#19712](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19712) arch/arm/nrf52/nrf53/nrf91: allow zero-length I2C transfers
* [#19748](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19748) arch/arm/nrf53: add DCDC regulator support
* [#19747](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19747) arch/arm/nrf53: add HFCLK XTAL oscillator support
* [#19822](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19822) arch/arm/nrf53: fix HFXO trim field extraction
* [#19746](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19746) arch/arm/nrf53: fix I2C3 base
* [#20002](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/20002) arch/arm/nrf53: fix inverted GPIOTE per-instance channel index
* [#19719](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19719) arch/arm/nrf5x: improve USBD stability
* [#18998](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/18998) arch/arm/nrf91: Fix OOB read/write in nrf91_usrsock_ioctl_handler
* [#19045](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19045) arch/arm/nrf91: fix broken modem initialization
* [#19046](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19046) arch/arm/nrf91: add more ioctl calls for modem socket
* [#19119](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19119) arch/arm/nrf91: add PWM support
* [#19128](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19128) arch/arm/nrf91: add GPIOTE support
* [#19129](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19129) arch/arm/nrf91: improvements for LTE API
* [#19130](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19130) arch/arm/nrf91: expose GNSS priority as a control ioctl
* [#19131](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19131) arch/arm/nrf91: improvements for GNSS
* [#19328](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19328) arch/arm/nrf91: bound modem version parsing
* [#19378](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19378) arch/arm/rp2040,rp23xx: fix CDC-NCM bulk/notify endpoint handling
* [#19530](https://github.com/apache/nuttx/pull/19530) arch/arm/rp23xx: add /dev/timer driver and tickless OS on the RP2350 system TIMER
